         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Requirements for initiating, planning, controlling, and executing the software quality assurance (SQA) processes of a software development or maintenance project are established in this standard. This standard is harmonized with the software life cycle processes of ISO/IEC/IEEE 12207:2017, IEEE Std 2675â„¢-2021, and the information content requirements of ISO/IEC/IEEE 15289:2019.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
